      <h1 id="advanced-build-operations" class="group scroll-mt-20">Performing advanced builds<a href="#advanced-build-operations" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>You can set build resources and maximum duration, assign builds to nodes, chain builds, prune builds, and configure build run policies.</p>
      <h2 id="builds-setting-build-resources_advanced-build-operations" class="group scroll-mt-20">Setting build resources<a href="#builds-setting-build-resources_advanced-build-operations" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
